{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "HEB",
  "chapter": 3,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore, holy brethren, partakers of a heavenly calling, consider the Apostle and High Priest of our confession, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Jesus;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "who was faithful to him that appointed him, as also was Moses in all his house.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he hath been counted worthy of more glory than Moses, by so much as he that built the house hath more honor than the house.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For every house is builded by some one; but he that built all things is God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Moses indeed was faithful in all his house as a servant, for a testimony of those things which were afterward to be spoken;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "but Christ as a son, over his house; whose house are we, if we hold fast our boldness and the glorying of our hope firm unto the end.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore, even as the Holy Spirit saith,To-day if ye shall hear his voice,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Harden not your hearts, as in the provocation,\nLike as in the day of the trial in the wilderness,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Where your fathers tried ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "me",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " by proving ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "me",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ",\nAnd saw my works forty years.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore I was displeased with this generation,\nAnd said, They do always err in their heart:\nBut they did not know my ways;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As I sware in my wrath,They shall not enter into my rest.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Take heed, brethren, lest haply there shall be in any one of you an evil heart of unbelief, in falling away from the living God:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "but exhort one another day by day, so long as it is called To-day; lest any one of you be hardened by the deceitfulness of sin:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "for we are become partakers of Christ, if we hold fast the beginning of our confidence firm unto the end:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "while it is said,To-day if ye shall hear his voice,\nHarden not your hearts, as in the provocation.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For who, when they heard, did provoke? nay, did not all they that came out of Egypt by Moses?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And with whom was he displeased forty years? was it not with them that sinned, whose bodies fell in the wilderness?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And to whom sware he that they should not enter into his rest, but to them that were disobedient?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "HEB.3.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:HEB.3.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And we see that they were not able to enter in because of unbelief.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
